{
  "widget": "YandexKit.FeaturedCollections",
  "summary": "Hand-entered image tiles (title, image, link). Not bound to the catalog: every card is typed in. The most versatile layout block: category tiles, split hero, diptych, bento, proof row, benefit mosaic, social grid.",
  "rules": [
    "Navigation tiles lead somewhere: category and collection tiles carry `linkSource` with a real path and id (only 187 of 1055 tiles in the reference sample are linked; do better).",
    "Tile titles are real category or collection names from the store, never template text.",
    "`snippet.aspectRatio: default` follows the theme `collectionSnippet.aspectRatio`, which keeps tiles and product photos in one ratio.",
    "`text.enableTitle: false` only when the artwork carries its own text. White overlay titles need `enableParanja: true` or a dark photo.",
    "`text.backgroundDark` is a number. No module with an empty `media.filePath`.",
    "`alignTitle` is `default` (as in the theme), `left` or `center`, and the schema requires it: presets write `default`, so a starter template's stored `left` does not survive under a centred theme. An older storefront build knows only `left` and `center`; there pass `--schema` with the store's skeleton and `presets apply` keeps the stored value.",
    "Phones by role: navigation tiles 2 per view (`enableTwoColumnsOnTouch: true`); editorial or story tiles (3 or more) as a carousel with `false`, one tile and a peek; a text-and-photo pair as a gapless 2-column grid with `false`, which stacks in tile order. Never a grid with `false` and 3 or more tiles (they stack one per row), never a 2-column carousel with `false` (the second tile shows as a sliver).",
    "Text baked into a tile image renders at about half size on phones: headlines survive, paragraphs do not. Prefer live titles."
  ],
  "skeleton_fix": {
    "text": {
      "vAlign": "underImage"
    }
  },
  "module_template": {
    "title": "<fill: tile title from the store or the merchant: a category or collection name, or the caption of a benefit or photo tile>",
    "media": "<fill: image object built from `kit.py media upload` output with `design.py media-object`; keep its `type`>",
    "linkSource": {
      "link": "<fill: /catalog/<slug>, /collections/<slug> or a page path; empty for a decorative tile>",
      "linkId": "<fill: the id of that category, collection or page; empty with an empty link>"
    }
  },
  "required_defaults": {
    "section": {
      "isFullscreen": "default",
      "paddingTop": "single",
      "paddingBottom": "single"
    },
    "snippet": {
      "aspectRatio": "default",
      "imageFit": "cover",
      "enableParanja": true,
      "background": "none",
      "enableBorder": false
    },
    "snippets": {
      "layout": "grid",
      "columns": 4,
      "enableTwoColumnsOnTouch": true,
      "hGap": "default",
      "vGap": "default"
    },
    "text": {
      "enableTitle": true,
      "hAlign": "left",
      "vAlign": "underImage",
      "titleSize": "md",
      "titleWeight": "medium",
      "titleColor": "",
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundDark": 0
    }
  },
